      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Quiet secondary action on an open reading field.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-outline\">Tengo un proyecto parecido <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-outline{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;min-height:52px;padding:14px 22px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-small,12px);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,color 180ms,transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);border:1px solid var(--line,color-mix(in srgb,#0b1430 16%,transparent));background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#0b1430)}.ds-outline svg{width:21px;height:21px}.ds-outline:hover{background:var(--surface,#f8faff);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-outline:active{transform:translateY(0)}.ds-outline:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-outline{transition:none}.ds-outline:hover{transform:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-outline"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Directional action without horizontal padding.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-text\">Ver capacidades <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-text{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;min-height:52px;padding:14px 22px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-small,12px);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms,color 180ms,transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);justify-content:flex-start;padding-inline:0;gap:14px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#0b1430)}.ds-text svg{width:21px;height:21px}.ds-text:hover{color:var(--blue-text,#1536f1);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-text:active{transform:translateY(0)}.ds-text:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text{transition:none}.ds-text:hover{transform:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-text"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contact Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Visible label, active reading material, and distinct focus border.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Email<input type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--ink,#0b1430);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;max-width:360px}.ds-field input{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);width:100%;min-width:0;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--bg,#eef2ff);color:var(--ink,#0b1430);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink,#0b1430) 35%,transparent);border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5}.ds-field input:focus{border-color:var(--blue-text,#1536f1)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}.ds-field input:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:wait}",
      "refersTo": "input"
    },
    {
      "name": "Concept Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Noninteractive publication-status metadata.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-concept-label\">Estudio conceptual</span>",
      "css": ".ds-concept-label{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line,color-mix(in srgb,#0b1430 16%,transparent));border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#4f5e7d)}",
      "refersTo": "concept-label"
    },
    {
      "name": "Form Surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Opaque, flat reading container; the actual form uses responsive padding.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-form-surface\"><h3>Tu consulta</h3></section>",
      "css": ".ds-form-surface{padding:36px;background:var(--surface,#f8faff);color:var(--ink,#0b1430);border-radius:var(--radius,16px);max-width:480px}.ds-form-surface h3{margin:0;font-family:var(--display,'Bricolage Grotesque Variable','Arial Narrow',sans-serif);font-size:29px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.55}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-form-surface{padding:24px}}@media(max-width:430px){.ds-form-surface{padding:22px}}",
      "refersTo": "form-surface"
    },
    {
      "name": "Home Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Fixed-dark functional glass with the preserved L/ and LPM treatment.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"NavegaciÃ³n de muestra\"><a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#inicio\"><span class=\"ds-brand-mark\">L/</span>LPM</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#soluciones\">Enfoque</a><a class=\"ds-nav-action\" href=\"#contacto\">Hablemos <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;min-height:76px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(5,9,20,.88);color:#eef3ff;box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.16);backdrop-filter:blur(20px)}.ds-nav a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.ds-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-right:auto;font-family:var(--display,'Bricolage Grotesque Variable','Arial Narrow',sans-serif);font-size:23px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;background:#1536f1;color:#fffdf7;border-radius:10px;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:color 180ms}.ds-nav-link:hover{color:#a5b9ff}.ds-nav-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue,#1536f1);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;transition:background-color 180ms,transform 180ms}.ds-nav-action svg{width:21px;height:21px}.ds-nav-action:hover{background:var(--blue-strong,#0d2ccf);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-nav-action:active{transform:none}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}@media(prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.ds-nav{background:#0b1123;backdrop-filter:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a{transition:none}.ds-nav-action:hover{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Perspective Choices",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Pressed-state control for the piece/whole-system scene.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-perspective-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Cambiar perspectiva\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Una pieza</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">El sistema</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-perspective-controls{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:5px;background:#10172b;border-radius:12px}.ds-perspective-controls button{font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#c2ceea;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.55;cursor:pointer}.ds-perspective-controls button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#1536f1;color:#fff}.ds-perspective-controls button:hover{color:#fff}.ds-perspective-controls button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}",
      "refersTo": "perspective-choice"
    },
    {
      "name": "Appearance Controls",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Light/dark buttons with pressed state and 44px targets.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-appearance\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Apariencia\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Modo claro\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.65 17.65l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.65 6.35l1.42-1.42\"/></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Modo oscuro\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.4 15.1A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.9 3.6a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 11.5 11.5Z\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-appearance{display:inline-flex;padding-left:12px;border-left:1px solid var(--line,color-mix(in srgb,#0b1430 16%,transparent))}.ds-appearance button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;padding:12px;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted,#4f5e7d);cursor:pointer}.ds-appearance button[aria-pressed=true]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink,#0b1430) 7%,transparent);color:var(--ink,#0b1430)}.ds-appearance button:hover{color:var(--blue-text,#1536f1)}.ds-appearance button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #111318;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}.ds-appearance svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Optical Union",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Fixed cobalt/sky geometry carries the portrait language into the service system.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-union\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-eye ds-eye-one\"></span><span class=\"ds-eye ds-eye-two\"></span><span class=\"ds-union-center\">L/</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-union{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;min-height:290px;border-radius:20px;background:#070c1b;isolation:isolate}.ds-eye{position:absolute;width:260px;height:150px;border-radius:78% 18% 78% 18%}.ds-eye-one{background:#1536f1;transform:translate(-50px,-30px) rotate(15deg)}.ds-eye-two{background:#b7d7ee;transform:translate(50px,35px) rotate(-15deg);mix-blend-mode:screen}.ds-union-center{z-index:1;display:grid;place-items:center;width:70px;height:70px;background:#070c1b;color:#eef3ff;border-radius:16px;font-family:var(--display,'Bricolage Grotesque Variable','Arial Narrow',sans-serif);font-weight:650;font-size:43px;letter-spacing:-.04em}@media(max-width:500px){.ds-eye{width:200px;height:120px}.ds-eye-one{transform:translate(-28px,-28px) rotate(15deg)}.ds-eye-two{transform:translate(28px,30px) rotate(-15deg)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Spatial Portrait Control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "spatial-control",
      "description": "Compact functional glass action that freezes the current 3D alien pose while keeping the canvas visible; device tilt is separately opt-in when supported.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-spatial-controls\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Pausar efecto espacial\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2v5m0 10v5M2 12h5m10 0h5M5 5l3 3m8 8 3 3M5 19l3-3m8-8 3-3\"/></svg><span>Pausar efecto</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-spatial-controls{display:inline-flex}.ds-spatial-controls button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #7788ad;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(5,9,20,.88);color:#e5edff;font-family:var(--body,'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,sans-serif);font-size:12px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;cursor:pointer;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px)}.ds-spatial-controls button:hover{background:#172743;border-color:#b7d7ee}.ds-spatial-controls button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b7d7ee;outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px #fffdf7}.ds-spatial-controls svg{width:16px;height:16px}@media(prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.ds-spatial-controls button{background:#0b1123;backdrop-filter:none;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Otra perspectiva",
    "overview": "A refined, licensed Grab3D alien head carries the cobalt identity through real volume and skeletal movement. Conservative cranial and cheek refinements preserve the original topology, UVs and rig, with authored smooth normals transported through the deformation. A seamless skin tile derived from the original portrait supplies triplanar blue pigment, correlated roughness and shallow physical relief; the portrait remains the complete static fallback. The live model is not pixel-identical to that artwork. A finite greeting and input-driven head/neck movement sit within black brand fields, cool reading surfaces, optical geometry and clear Spanish copy.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A refined cobalt alien with actual head volume, physical skin detail and skeletal movement; the detailed original portrait remains the static fallback.",
      "Cold light and midnight reading appearances around fixed black brand fields.",
      "Bricolage messages with quiet Plex explanations and controls.",
      "Eye-shaped apertures, two disciplines plus their visible union, and open editorial groups.",
      "Purposeful perspective and 3D-alien interactions, with complete static fallbacks."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Fixed Encounter Rule",
        "body": "Keep the portrait opening and optical brand fields dark in both appearances. Theme changes apply to reading surfaces and active control roles.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Blues Rule",
        "body": "Use blue for theme-aware filled actions and blue-text for theme-aware links. Fixed brand artwork uses brand-cobalt and sky, independent of dark-theme overrides.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Expressive Head, Quiet Body Rule",
        "body": "Use Bricolage for the message and Plex for explanation, navigation, and controls. Keep complete word boundaries at narrow widths.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Functional Glass Rule",
        "body": "Use translucent material for the home navigation and small spatial-portrait controls. Keep reading, form, and legal-header surfaces opaque; preserve the opaque preference fallback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the L/ and LPM logo, fixed cobalt/sky artwork, and separate active theme roles.",
      "**Do** carry the gaze into optical geometry instead of relying on the portrait alone.",
      "**Do** pair expressive headings with readable Plex copy, bounded measures, and open content groups.",
      "**Do** keep the complete system readable in both perspective states and preserve reduced-motion and no-JavaScript fallbacks for both authored interactions.",
      "**Do** preserve visible labels, consent, status feedback, keyboard focus, and direct WhatsApp access.",
      "**Do** label illustrative portfolio work as conceptual until client material is approved for publication.",
      "**Do** scope the native pixel cursor to fine hover pointers and preserve editing, waiting, disabled, and forced-colors affordances."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore the retired warm-paper editorial world when extending this identity.",
      "**Don't** add fake telemetry, arbitrary coordinates, starfields, terminal styling, sound, cursor followers, trails, `cursor: none`, or hijacked scrolling.",
      "**Don't** apply glass to reading or form surfaces.",
      "**Don't** add looping autoplay or unrelated animation sequences beyond the finite alien greeting, input-driven 3D character, and perspective scene.",
      "**Don't** present concept imagery as approved client projects, results, or testimonials.",
      "**Don't** promote miniature text inside decorative concept artwork into a reading or control type role."
    ]
  }
}

